    "content": "# Murudeshwar Scuba Diving Price (2026)\n\n**Short answer:** Scuba diving at Netrani Island from Murudeshwar costs **₹3,500 per person** for a 30–40 minute dive, or **₹4,500 per person** for a 45–55 minute dive. Both prices include the boat trip, a personal instructor, all gear, and free underwater photos and videos.\n\n## 2026 price list\n\n| Package | Underwater time | Price per person | Best for |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Full Netrani Dive | 30–40 minutes, up to about 12 m | **₹3,500** | First-timers, families, non-swimmers |\n| Extended Deep Dive | 45–55 minutes | **₹4,500** | People who are comfortable in water and want more time on the reef |\n\nThese are the only two scuba packages we run. If you see an older or lower price on a website or in a social media post, call us to confirm before you travel.\n\n## What's included in the price\n\nBoth packages include:\n- The return boat trip from Murudeshwar beach to Netrani Island, about 19 km each way\n- A safety briefing and breathing practice before the dive\n- A **1:1 certified instructor** for the whole dive\n- Full equipment: wetsuit, mask, fins, BCD jacket, regulator and a filled cylinder\n- Surface snorkelling gear while you wait on the boat\n- Refreshments on board\n- **Free HD underwater photos and videos**, sent to your phone the same day\n\n## What's not included\n\n- Your travel to Murudeshwar, and your food and stay there\n- Parking fees at the temple parking area, if any apply\n- Personal expenses\n\n## Why do Netrani scuba prices vary so much online?\n\nSearch \"Netrani scuba diving price\" and you'll see figures from under ₹2,000 to over ₹6,000. Several things explain the gap:\n\n1. **Boat trip included or not.** Some low prices cover only the dive, and the boat is charged separately.\n2. **Dive time.** A 10–15 minute dive costs less than a 30–40 minute one. Always ask how long you'll actually be underwater.\n3. **Instructor ratio.** Is it 1:1, or one instructor managing two or three people?\n4. **Photos.** Some operators charge extra for photos and videos.\n5. **Where you dive.** Some cheaper \"scuba\" trips are shallow dives near the shore, not at Netrani.\n6. **Booking platform markup.** Travel aggregators add their own margin on top of the operator's price.\n\n**Before you pay, ask any operator these five questions:**\n- How many minutes will I be underwater?\n- Is the boat included?\n- Is my instructor only with me?\n- Are photos included?\n- Is the dive at Netrani Island?\n\n## Price for groups and families\n\nThe price is the same per person whether you come alone or with family. For groups of 10 or more, such as college groups, corporate trips or tour groups, see our [bulk scuba booking page](/bulk-scuba-booking) or call us for a group quote.\n\nNon-divers can sometimes join the boat. Call ahead to check whether there's space and what it costs, because seats are limited.\n\n## Advance and payment\n\n- Pay a **₹500 per person advance** to hold your boat seat and instructor.\n- Pay the balance in **cash or UPI** at check-in on the morning of the dive.\n\n## Cancellation and refunds\n\n| Situation | What happens to the ₹500 advance |\n|---|---|\n| You cancel 48 hours or more before the dive date | Full refund |\n| You cancel within 48 hours | Not refunded |\n| No-show on the dive morning | Not refunded |\n| Trip cancelled because of weather or a port advisory | Full refund, or free reschedule |\n\n## Is the ₹4,500 extended dive worth it?\n\nPick the **₹4,500 Extended Deep Dive** if:\n- you've dived before, or you're relaxed in water\n- you want more time to explore the reef and take photos\n- you're travelling a long way and want the most out of the trip\n\nPick the **₹3,500 Full Netrani Dive** if:\n- it's your first time\n- you're nervous or can't swim\n- you're diving with children aged 10 or older\n\nNot sure? Start with the standard dive. Your instructor will tell you on the day how comfortable you were.\n\n## FAQs\n\n**What is the cheapest scuba diving package in Murudeshwar?**\nOur lowest price is ₹3,500 per person for the Full Netrani Dive with 30–40 minutes underwater.\n\n**Is GST included?**\nThe prices shown are what you pay. Confirm on your booking call if you need a GST invoice.\n\n**Do children pay less?**\nNo. Children aged 10 and above dive with their own instructor and pay the same price.\n\n**Can I pay everything online?**\nOnly the ₹500 advance is paid online. The balance is paid at check-in.\n\n---\n\nCheck availability: call **+91 78299 75777** or WhatsApp **+91 74063 29777**. To compare prices with other dive destinations, read our guide to [scuba diving prices in India](/blog/scuba-diving-price-india).\n\n👉\n"
