    "content": "# Murudeshwar Railway Station: How to Get to the Temple and Beach\n\n## Quick answer\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Nearest railway station | **Murudeshwar (station code: MRDW)** |\n| Railway line | Konkan Railway |\n| Distance to Murudeshwar temple and beach | About **3 km** |\n| Transport from the station | Auto-rickshaw, about 10 minutes |\n\n## Where is the station?\n\nMurudeshwar Railway Station is inland from the town, on the Konkan Railway line between Mangaluru and Goa. The temple, the Shiva statue and the beach are all together on the coast, about 3 km from the station.\n\n## Station to temple: your options\n\n**Auto-rickshaw (easiest)**\nAutos wait outside the station when trains arrive. The ride to the temple or beach takes about 10 minutes. Agree the fare before you get in, because rates change and can be higher early in the morning or late at night.\n\n**Walking**\nIt's possible, but 3 km with luggage on a road with traffic isn't much fun. It's fine for light travellers in the cool morning.\n\n**Hotel pickup**\nSome hotels near the temple arrange station pickups. Ask when you book your room.\n\n## Which trains stop at Murudeshwar?\n\nMurudeshwar is served by Konkan Railway trains on the Mangaluru–Goa–Mumbai corridor, plus connections from Bengaluru via Mangaluru. Not every express stops here. Check IRCTC or the Konkan Railway site for current trains, timings and stops before you travel.\n\n## Other nearby stations\n\nIf you can't get a ticket to MRDW:\n- **Bhatkal (BTJL):** a short road trip south of Murudeshwar. Take an auto, taxi or bus to Murudeshwar.\n- **Honnavar (HNA):** to the north. Take a bus or taxi along NH 66.\n\nMany more trains stop at these stations, so they're good backups.\n\n## Coming for a scuba dive?\n\nOur dive day starts with **reporting at 8:00 AM** at the dive desk on Temple Main Road, near the temple and beach.\n\n- **Arriving by an early-morning train?** Allow time for the auto ride and breakfast.\n- **Arriving late at night?** Stay near the temple so you're a short walk from the dive desk in the morning.\n- **Leaving the same day?** We're usually back on shore by 2:30–3:00 PM. Book a train after about 4:30 PM to leave time for the auto and a meal.\n\n## Other ways to reach Murudeshwar\n\n- **Bus:** buses on NH 66 stop at Murudeshwar Highway Cross, 5 minutes from the beach by auto.\n- **Air:** Mangaluru International Airport (IXE) is about 160 km south. The Goa airports are further north.\n\nFull details are in [how to reach Murudeshwar](/how-to-reach-murudeshwar).\n\n## FAQs\n\n**What is the Murudeshwar railway station code?**\nMRDW.\n\n**How far is Murudeshwar temple from the railway station?**\nAbout 3 km, roughly 10 minutes by auto.\n\n**Is there a bus from the station to the temple?**\nAutos are the most reliable option. Local buses run along the highway, but not always to the station.\n\n**Can I leave my luggage during the dive?**\nAsk us when you book. We'll tell you about safe options near the dive desk on the day.\n\n---\n\nPlanning a dive? Call **+91 78299 75777** or WhatsApp **+91 74063 29777**.\n\n👉\n"
