    "content": "# How to Book Netrani Island Scuba Diving\n\nBooking a Netrani scuba dive takes about five minutes. Here's exactly how it works, what it costs, and what happens if plans change.\n\n## Booking in 4 steps\n\n**Step 1: Contact us with your details**\nCall **+91 78299 75777** or WhatsApp **+91 74063 29777** and tell us:\n- your dive date, with a backup date if you're flexible\n- the number of divers and their ages (divers must be 10–60)\n- your package: ₹3,500 (30–40 min) or ₹4,500 (45–55 min)\n- any health conditions we should know about\n\n**Step 2: Pay the ₹500 advance**\nPay **₹500 per diver** online to block your boat seat and your 1:1 instructor. We'll share the payment details on the call or chat.\n\n**Step 3: Get your confirmation**\nYou'll get a booking confirmation with your date, your package, the number of divers, and the reporting time and place.\n\n**Step 4: Report on the dive morning**\n- **Time:** 8:00 AM\n- **Place:** our dive desk on Temple Main Road, near Murudeshwar temple and beach\n- **Bring:** your confirmation, ID, swimwear, a towel and a change of clothes\n- **Pay the balance** in cash or UPI at check-in\n\n## Netrani Island scuba diving cost\n\n| Package | Dive time | Total price | Advance | Balance at check-in |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Full Netrani Dive | 30–40 min | ₹3,500 | ₹500 | ₹3,000 |\n| Extended Deep Dive | 45–55 min | ₹4,500 | ₹500 | ₹4,000 |\n\nThe price includes the boat, a 1:1 instructor, all gear, snorkelling gear, refreshments and free photos and videos. See the [full price guide](/blog/murudeshwar-scuba-diving-price-cost).\n\n## How early should you book?\n\n- **Weekends, festivals and school holidays** (October–May): book a week or more ahead.\n- **Weekdays:** a few days ahead is often enough.\n- **Same-day:** sometimes possible. Call us before 7:30 AM to ask.\n\nSlots are limited every day because each diver gets their own instructor.\n\n## Cancellation and refund policy\n\n| Situation | Advance |\n|---|---|\n| You cancel **48 hours or more** before the dive date | **Full refund** |\n| You cancel **within 48 hours** | Not refunded |\n| **No-show** on the dive morning | Not refunded |\n| **Weather or port advisory** cancels the trip | **Full refund**, or **free reschedule** |\n\nFull terms are on our [terms page](/terms).\n\n## What if the weather is bad?\n\nNetrani is in the open sea. If the coastal or port authorities issue a weather alert, or the swell is unsafe, the boat doesn't go out. We'll contact you, and you can choose a full refund or a new date. Book flexible travel tickets if you can.\n\n## Booking for a group\n\nFor 10 or more divers, such as college trips, office outings or tour groups, use our [bulk booking page](/bulk-scuba-booking). We'll plan boat rotations so the whole group dives the same morning.\n\n## Booking tips to avoid surprises\n\n- **Book directly with the operator.** Aggregator listings often add a markup.\n- **Confirm what's included.** Ask whether the boat, photos and a 1:1 instructor are in the price.\n- **Mention health issues** at the time of booking, not at check-in.\n- **Plan travel after 3:30 PM** on the dive day.\n- **Save our number** in case you're running late.\n\n## FAQs\n\n**Can I book online without calling?**\nContact us by WhatsApp, and we'll confirm availability and send payment details in the chat.\n\n**Can I change my package after booking?**\nUsually, yes, depending on availability. Ask before the dive day.\n\n**Can I change the diver's name?**\nYes. Just tell us before the dive day.\n\n**Is the advance per person or per booking?**\nPer person: ₹500 per diver.\n\n---\n\n**Book now:** call **+91 78299 75777** or WhatsApp **+91 74063 29777**.\n\n👉\n"
