    "content": "\n# Scuba Trip From Gokarna (2026): Same-Day vs Overnight Plan\n\nWelcome to our comprehensive guide on **Scuba Trip From Gokarna (2026): Same-Day vs Overnight Plan**.\n\nIf you are planning a scuba diving trip to **Netrani Island, Murudeshwar**, this article provides essential insights into this topic.\n\n## Key Information\n\n* **Direct Operator Support:** Call [+91 78299 75777](tel:+917829975777) for instant confirmation.\n* **Timing:** Morning reporting from 8 AM daily.\n* **Season:** October to May. Closed during monsoon.\n\n---\n\n## Distance & Travel Logistics: Gokarna to Murudeshwar\n\nGokarna and Murudeshwar are two of Karnataka's most famous coastal gems, separated by only **78 km** along the scenic National Highway 66 (NH 66).\n\n* **By Private Cab / Taxi:** 1.5 to 2 hours drive. One-way taxi fares range between ₹2,200 and ₹3,000.\n* **By Train (Konkan Railway):** Direct trains run between *Gokarna Road (GOK)* and *Murudeshwar (MRDW)*, taking approximately 1 hour.\n* **By KSRTC / Private Bus:** Regular buses operate along the Kumta-Honnavar-Murudeshwar highway every 20-30 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## Option 1: The Same-Day Gokarna to Murudeshwar Scuba Itinerary\n\nIf your base hotel is in Gokarna (Kudle Beach, Om Beach, or Gokarna town), you can comfortably complete your scuba dive in a single day:\n\n* **06:00 AM:** Depart Gokarna by cab or early morning bus via NH 66.\n* **07:45 AM:** Arrive at Murudeshwar Temple Beach and check in at the Murudeshwar Scuba Dive desk.\n* **08:30 AM:** Board the dive boat and head to Netrani Island for your guided dive and snorkeling session.\n* **02:45 PM:** Return to Murudeshwar shore, freshen up, and collect your underwater photos and videos.\n* **03:30 PM - 05:00 PM:** Visit the Murudeshwar Temple and Raja Gopura for panoramic sunset views.\n* **05:30 PM:** Drive back to Gokarna in time for a relaxing beachside dinner at Om Beach or Kudle Beach.\n\n---\n\n## Option 2: The 2-Day Gokarna + Murudeshwar Combo Plan\n\nFor a more leisurely pace, combine the best of both destinations over a weekend:\n\n* **Day 1 (Gokarna):** Explore Mahabaleshwar Temple, hike the 5 beaches trail (Paradise, Half Moon, Om, Kudle, Gokarna Main), and catch the sunset at Om Beach.\n* **Day 2 (Murudeshwar):** Morning drive to Murudeshwar, complete your Netrani Island scuba dive, enjoy coastal Karavali cuisine for lunch, and explore the Shiva statue before heading onward.\n    "
